      <MissionDesc>All children deserve access to community, care, and education. Unfortunately, far too many families raising young children with disabilities in San Diego County are not finding that access. Includ(Ed) was established to address the county-wide, pervasive need for quality, fully inclusive preschool and childcare for families raising children with disabilities. We build inclusive, early intervention-focused early learning classrooms and communities where babies, toddlers, and children with disabilities can thrive alongside their typically-developing peers.</MissionDesc>
